Description: Manage your own fingerprints with any fprintd-compatible service
 (net.reactivated.Fprint)
 A small desktop application to register your right index finger, or remove it,
 in one plain screen. Made for desktops without fingerprint settings of their
 own, such as Xfce, MATE and LXQt. It works with any fingerprint service that
 speaks the fprintd D-Bus interface, fprintd itself included. Your password
 always keeps working.

